repository-code: 'https://github.com/nzilbb/quisperx'
abstract: >-
  QuisperX is a version of Max Bain et al's WhisperX, which
  adds easy access to two extra models fine-tuned on the
  QuakeBox corpus of New Zealand English speech, tweaks to
  WebVTT output to use certain transcription conventions for
  marking of inter-word pauses and transcription of
  interrupted words, and WebVTT output labels speakers using
  voice tags.
